  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]  [C]\n[G]  [C]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D/F#][G]Whenever I'm\n[Em]weary From the\n[Am]battles that [G]rage in\n[D/F#]my head\n[G]You [D/F#]make sense of\n[Em]madness When my\n[Am]sanity [G]hangs by a\n[D/F#]thread\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]I lose my way\n[B7]but still you\n[Em]seem to [D]understand\n[C#m7b5]Now and fore-\n[Am]ver,\n[D]I will be your man\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[G]  [C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D/F#][G]Sometimes I just hold\n[Em]you\n[Am]Too caught up [G]in\n[D/F#]me to see\n[G]I'm [D/F#]holding a\n[Em]fortune That\n[Am]heaven has [G]given to\n[D/F#]me\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]I'll try to show\n[B7]you each and\n[Em]every way [D]I can\n[C#m7b5]Now and fore-\n[Am]ver,\n[D]I will be your man\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[G]  [C]\n[B7]Now I can rest\n\n[Bridge]\n[Em]my [C]worries and\n[G]always be sure [D]\n[Em]That I won't [C]be alone\n[G]anymore [D]\n[Em]If I'd [C]only known\n[G]you were there [D]all the time\n[Am]All this\n[C]time\n\n[Solo]\n[G]  [D/F#]\n[Em]\n[Am]  [G]\n[D/F#]\n[G]  [D/F#]\n[Em]\n[Am]  [G]\n[D/F#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Until the day\n[B7]the ocean\n[Em]doesn't touch [D]the sand\n[C#m7b5]Now and fore-\n[Am]ver,\n[D]I will be your man\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[G]  [C]\nNow and fore-\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]ver,\n[D]I will be\nyour\n[C]man\n[Cm]\n[G]",
